    If your real interest is closer to environmental work or life sciences specifically, our
    <a href="/blog/career-options/environmental-science-career-options">environmental science career
    options</a> guide and our
    <a href="/blog/career-options/life-sciences-and-biological-sciences-career-options">biological sciences
